      "excerpt": "Germanium Overdrive - B85 audio Mus\u00edte zm\u011bnit nastaven\u00ed va\u0161eho prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010de Pod\u00edvejte se na: Jak povolit JavaScript ve va\u0161em prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010di . Pokud pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1te software na blokov\u00e1n\u00ed reklam, m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt nutn\u00e9 povolit JavaScript z t\u00e9to str\u00e1nky. D\u011bkujeme. Tento web pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 soubory cookie. Dal\u0161\u00edm proch\u00e1zen\u00edm tohoto webu vyjad\u0159ujete souhlas s jejich pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00edm.. V\u00edce informac\u00ed zde . Nastaven\u00ed Souhlas\u00edm P\u0159ej\u00edt na obsah Zp\u011bt do obchodu P\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed k va\u0161emu \u00fa\u010dtu E-mail Heslo Nevypl\u0148ujte toto pole Surname P\u0159ihl\u00e1sit se Nov\u00e1 registrace Zapomenut\u00e9 heslo nebo P\u0159ihl\u00e1sit se p\u0159es Facebook P\u0159ihl\u00e1sit se p\u0159es Google Efekty Aktivn\u00ed elektronika Zak\u00e1zky & servis R.I.P. Information in English Kontakt Obchodn\u00ed podm\u00ednky P\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed V\u00edce Hledat P\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed N\u00e1kupn\u00ed ko\u0161\u00edk Menu Dom\u016f / Efekty / Germanium Overdrive Postrann\u00ed panel Germanium Overdrive Skladem 1 kus. Skladem / In stock K\u00f3d: GO Zna\u010dka: B85 audio 2 500 K\u010d M\u011brn\u00e1 cena: Mno\u017estv\u00ed &plus; &minus; Do ko\u0161\u00edku Kategorie : Efekty Z\u00e1ruka : 2 roky Tisk Zeptat se Sd\u00edlet Tweet Zav\u0159\u00edt ZDARMA ZDARMA Popis Videa (6) Diskuze B85 Audio Germanium Overdrive je podlahov\u00fd efekt postaven\u00fd na legend\u00e1rn\u00edm zapojen\u00ed Tube Screamer 808, roz\u0161\u00ed\u0159en\u00fd o dvoup\u00e1smov\u00fd ekvaliz\u00e9r a germaniov\u00e9 diody pro p\u0159irozen\u011bj\u0161\u00ed, dynami\u010dt\u011bj\u0161\u00ed a muzik\u00e1ln\u011bj\u0161\u00ed zkreslen\u00ed. D\u00edky sv\u00e9 konstrukci si zachov\u00e1v\u00e1 klasick\u00fd overdrive charakter, ale z\u00e1rove\u0148 nab\u00edz\u00ed v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed flexibilitu v tvarov\u00e1n\u00ed v\u00fdsledn\u00e9ho zvuku. Ovl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed Level \u2013 celkov\u00e1 v\u00fdstupn\u00ed hlasitost Drive \u2013 m\u00edra zkreslen\u00ed Bass \u2013 \u00faprava n\u00edzk\u00fdch frekvenc\u00ed (+/- 15 dB p\u0159i 85 Hz) Treble \u2013 \u00faprava vysok\u00fdch frekvenc\u00ed (+/- 15 dB p\u0159i 8800 Hz) Efekt je osazen kvalitn\u00edmi sou\u010d\u00e1stkami \u2013 potenciometry Alpha-Pots nebo Hongh, jack konektory Neutrik a no\u017en\u00edm sp\u00edna\u010dem s \u017eivotnost\u00ed a\u017e 30 000 sepnut\u00ed. Nap\u00e1jen\u00ed je mo\u017en\u00e9 9V bateri\u00ed nebo extern\u00edm adapt\u00e9rem 9\u201312 V DC. Pro pou\u017eit\u00ed s baskytarou doporu\u010dujeme nap\u00e1jen\u00ed 12 V, kter\u00e9 zajist\u00ed v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed headroom a pevn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed odezvu. Ka\u017ed\u00fd kus je kompletn\u011b ru\u010dn\u011b vyr\u00e1b\u011bn\u00fd, v\u010detn\u011b osazen\u00ed a p\u00e1jen\u00ed plo\u0161n\u00fdch spoj\u016f. Efekt je vhodn\u00fd pro elektrickou kytaru i baskytaru Parametry a specifikace: Typ: Overdrive Ovl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed: Level, Bass, Treble, Drive True bypass: Ano Vstup: Mono V\u00fdstup: Mono Nap\u00e1jen\u00ed: 9V Bateri\u00ed nebo adapt\u00e9r 9V a\u017e 12V DC Center negative (Baterie ani adapt\u00e9r nen\u00ed sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed) Rozm\u011bry: cca X=119 mm, Y=100 mm, Z=52 mm ( rozm\u011bry jsou uv\u00e1d\u011bny se v\u0161emi namontovan\u00fdmi d\u00edly, pou\u017eit\u00e1 krabi\u010dka Hammond 1590BB \u010di ekvivalent ) B85 Audio Germanium Overdrive is a floor effect pedal based on the legendary Tube Screamer 808 circuit, expanded with a two-band equalizer and germanium diodes for a more natural, dynamic, and musical overdrive character. Thanks to its design, it retains the classic overdrive feel while offering greater flexibility in shaping the final sound. Controls Level \u2013 overall output volume Drive \u2013 amount of distortion Bass \u2013 low-frequency adjustment (+/- 15 dB at 85 Hz) Treble \u2013 high-frequency adjustment (+/- 15 dB at 8800 Hz) The pedal is built using high-quality components, including Alpha-Pots or Hongh potentiometers, Neutrik jack connectors, and footswitch rated for up to 30,000 actuations. It can be powered by a 9V battery or an external 9\u201312 V DC power supply. For bass guitar use, we recommend 12 V operation for greater headroom and a tighter response. Each unit is fully handcrafted, including PCB assembly and soldering. The effect is suitable for both electric guitar and bass guitar. 1 2 3 4 5 6 Diskuze Bu\u010fte prvn\u00ed, kdo nap\u00ed\u0161e p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek k t\u00e9to polo\u017ece. P\u0159idat koment\u00e1\u0159 Povinn\u00e1 pole Jm\u00e9no Nevypl\u0148ujte toto pole Surname E-mail N\u00e1zev Koment\u00e1\u0159 Vlo\u017een\u00edm koment\u00e1\u0159e souhlas\u00edte s podm\u00ednkami ochrany osobn\u00edch \u00fadaj\u016f Odeslat koment\u00e1\u0159 Ko\u0161\u00edk Zp\u011bt do obchodu Zp\u011bt do obchodu Co pot\u0159ebujete naj\u00edt? Hledat Doporu\u010dujeme 3PBP - 3 p\u00e1smov\u00fd basov\u00fd preamp 1 300 K\u010d Thor 4 000 K\u010d Hrom 2 500 K\u010d Z\u00e1pat\u00ed Kontakt info @ b85audio.cz 724136132 B85audio b85audio Youtube Instagram Sledovat na Instagramu Buy on Reverb.com Vytvo\u0159il Shoptet Copyright 2026 B85 audio . V\u0161echna pr\u00e1va vyhrazena.",
